      "writtenOn": "2022-10-10T07:59:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Even before writing a design document, I\u0027d suggest filing a bug/issue on b/381517 (Building AOSP) on the public issue tracker, or any other bug component, and getting someone on the team to respond. Emails can get lost easily. soong-discuss is also not public.\n\nPartners should also be reaching out to their respective TAMs for assistance.\n\nLet\u0027s avoid investment into a design document if the premise doesn\u0027t sound right.",
